cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying article."
title: "AirResilience: configurable simulation of disruption propagation in scheduled operations"
abstract: >-
  A configuration-driven discrete-event simulator for disruption propagation in
  timetabled operations. Duty-time regulations are declarative data, runs are
  recorded in a portable trace format with per-parameter provenance, and a
  dependency-free browser viewer renders any trace. Validated against real
  operations data from the US DOT Bureau of Transportation Statistics.
